</span></td></tr>
<tr id="S1.T1.2.1.9" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="S1.T1.2.1.9.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_l ltx_border_r">
<span id="S1.T1.2.1.9.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:455.2pt;">
<span id="S1.T1.2.1.9.1.1.1" class="ltx_p">一个半月了，不消肿 ，是摔得，伤口特别深，有半厘米左右，伤口的周围红肿，一按有小坑，而且半天不回去，跟水肿了似得，怎么办啊？// It’s been a month and a half, and the swelling hasn’t gone down. It was a fall, and the wound was particularly deep, about half a centimeter. The area around the wound is red and swollen. When pressed, it forms a small pit that takes a long time to go back, looking like edema. What should I do?</span>
